    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "영작문제 2 답안"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "다음 문제를 영작해주세요."
    },
    {
      "type": "sentences",
      "items": [
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Create an important permanent memorial."
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Why don't you create a museum of freedom and remembrance?"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "He established an international design process."
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "The company constructs(builds) the most moving memorial possible."
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "Why does the Mayor outrage some groups?"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "Who appointed the 16-member panel?"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "It will handle(deal with) redevelopment."
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "Where are the relatives of the victims?"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "Where is new evidence?"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "How did he get away?"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "Don't forget it."
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "Are you a multi-millionaire?"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "We have many loyal viewers in Alaska."
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "Does Alaska have a time zone, too?"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "They have many time zones, don't they?"
        },
        {
          "n": "16",
          "text": "We'll have more stories in just a moment."
        },
        {
          "n": "17",
          "text": "Secretary of State Collin Powell is returning home from his Mid East trip."
        },
        {
          "n": "18",
          "text": "There are mixed reviews about the progress."
        },
        {
          "n": "19",
          "text": "Why didn't Powell meet with Egyptian President Mubarak?"
        }
      ]
    },
